19. METHOD 17: @push AND @stack
============================================================

These directives organize page-specific scripts and styles.

IN A BLADE PAGE:

@push('scripts')

    <script>
        console.log('Employee page loaded');
    </script>

@endpush


IN THE MAIN LAYOUT, BEFORE </body>:

